 {dialog==='import'&&<Modal title="Watchlist import and export" onClose={close} wide><div className="wl-modal-content"><p>TXT imports exchange-prefixed identifiers into a new unresolved list. A line that starts with ### names a section for the symbols after it (an OpenCandle text layout, not a reference format). A ###Name entry between commas also starts a section, so a one-line export with ###Name entries keeps its sections. JSON merges local lists and notes with fresh identities, keeping existing flags and display preferences. TXT cannot retain notes. No data connection is opened.</p><button disabled={busy} onClick={()=>void importFile()}>Choose TXT or JSON</button><label>Import format<Select aria-label="Import format" value={format} onChange={next=>editImportDraft(()=>setFormat(next as typeof format))} options={[{value:'txt',label:'Exchange-prefixed TXT'},{value:'json',label:'OpenCandle watchlist JSON'}]}/></label><label>New TXT list name<input value={name} onChange={event=>editImportDraft(()=>setName(event.target.value))}/></label><textarea aria-label="Watchlist import text" value={paste} onChange={event=>editImportDraft(()=>setPaste(event.target.value))} placeholder="NYSE:GME,AMEX:SPY"/><button disabled={busy||!paste} onClick={importPasted}>Import pasted list</button><hr/><button disabled={busy} onClick={()=>void exportFile('json')}>Export full watchlist JSON</button><label><input type="checkbox" checked={flatten} onChange={event=>setFlatten(event.target.checked)}/>Flatten sections for TXT export (leaves out the ### lines)</label><label><input type="checkbox" checked={inlineTxt} disabled={flatten} onChange={event=>setInlineTxt(event.target.checked)}/>Write TXT on one line, with ###Name entries between the tickers</label><button disabled={busy} onClick={()=>void exportFile('txt')}>Export active list TXT</button></div><footer><span role="alert">{error}</span><button onClick={close}>Cancel</button></footer></Modal>}
